  "pathSyntax": "dot-separated segments; a numeric segment indexes an array; the leaf value is compared with deep JSON equality",
  "factSelector": "a fact selects the chain event by spanId when present; otherwise by kind+nodeKey+status (S5 convention). Derived '#trace.*' facts need no selector.",
  "derivedPathSyntax": "paths starting with '#trace.' are computed over the whole source before fact lookup: spanCount, kindCount (spans per kind, object), fetchCount, backendSpanCount, hasFrontend, hasBackend, serviceSpanCount, valuesSpanCount (spans that carry a values array), valueCount (total value items), localValueCount (value items with kind=local), l2FlagSpanCount (spans whose flags contain L2), invocationIndexes, invocationValueCounts (value items per reconcileAmount span ordered by startNs), serviceReturnValues, graphNodeKeyCount",
